From: LF5 <lf524prod24061993@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] MiuiCamera: use live logical display metrics on AOSP

Camera 5.3.001510.1 keeps app bounds in preferences and keys their validity
only to persist.sys.miui_resolution. WindowManager logical size changes
leave that MIUI property unchanged, reusing 1440x3200 bounds in a 1080x2400
window even after a cold start.

Read current WindowMetrics instead. Include density in the in-memory layout
cache check and invalidate cached system bar dimensions before rebuilding.
MiuiX AutoDensity must also obtain its logical size from DisplayMetrics,
keeping the physical supported-mode size for the panel-inch calculation.

No camera stream sizes, native libraries, resources, or sensor settings change.

